{"id":"506805","name":"腌黄瓜丝","author":"Qiuyue0815","authorId":"7992337","desc":"","cover":"images/506805/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"酱油","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"花椒粒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"大料","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"辣椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蚝油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备食材。","img":"images/506805/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"黄瓜切小段。","img":"images/506805/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"每段再十字切。","img":"images/506805/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"用盐腌出水份。","img":"images/506805/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"把黄瓜码在干果机上。","img":"images/506805/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"设置63度。","img":"images/506805/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"时间约为9小时烘干。","img":"images/506805/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"黄瓜放容器。","img":"images/506805/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"酱油。","img":"images/506805/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"煮开晾凉。","img":"images/506805/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"炒锅多倒一些油，小火炸香花椒、大料、辣椒晾凉。","img":"images/506805/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"把干黄瓜丝放入容器，倒入酱油。","img":"images/506805/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放入姜片、蒜。","img":"images/506805/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"把花椒大料油一起倒在黄瓜里，差不多能用油封住容器口的样子即可。","img":"images/506805/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"烘干黄瓜时可根据自己需要黄瓜的干温程度设置，想吃脆的，少烘（或晾晒）一会儿，想吃有韧性的就多烘一会儿 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}